Protocol knowledge attribution
------------------------------

The xTool F1 legacy transport in crates/laser-protocol is an independent Rust
implementation. Its port numbers, session command sequence, laser-source
commands and power scale were learned from:

  BeamInk — https://github.com/sfn-tools/BeamInk
  Copyright (c) 2026 something.fromnothing.blog - Tools
  MIT License

No BeamInk source code is included in this repository.

Firmware-family information (V1 REST vs WS-V2) was learned from the protocol
notes of ha-xtool (https://github.com/thecodingdad/ha-xtool). No code is included.

